        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;What’s the scariest part of any campfire story? The moment you realize it might just be true.&quot;</i><br> <br>&quot;Campfire Stories&quot; is a love letter to the terrifying tales of American folklore. This first chapter, &quot;The Giant of Green Peaks,&quot; pits you against our version of a legendary cryptid. You are no longer a listener — you are the main character in a living campfire legend. Immerse yourself in a compact, intense experience of a primal fight for survival in the territory of an intelligent, stalking predator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature List:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A New Horror Anthology: This is the first chapter in the &quot;Campfire Stories&quot; series, dedicated to bringing the monsters of American folklore to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart-Pounding Pursuit &amp; Stealth: Experience intense chase sequences followed by tense moments of silent hiding. Your wits and patience are your only weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Sound Design: A haunting tribal soundtrack and immersive soundscape of the deep woods will keep your heart racing and your nerves on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Compact, Gripping Experience: An intense 60-minute story that delivers a powerful, memorable horror punch.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841750/extras/ae35c8bffe10c79a9ec0c98431ae8b71.avif?t=1761555890\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Notice any translation inaccuracies or want to suggest localization improvements? Welcome to our Discord — we're looking forward to your edits and suggestions in the #feedback channel!</p>",
